.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent

.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items
.apdisk

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb

